{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2022-04-25 08:00:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL CELEBRATES ITS 1,000TH HOTEL IN EUROPE, MIDDLE EAST AND AFRICA', 'text': "THE COMPANY EXPECTS TO ADD OVER 200 PROPERTIES IN EMEA ACROSS 2022 AND 2023 LONDON , APRIL 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NASDAQ: MAR) TODAY CELEBRATED THE LAUNCH OF THE WESTIN LONDON CITY, ITS 1,000TH HOTEL IN EUROPE, MIDDLE EAST AND AFRICA (EMEA). A FLAGSHIP WESTIN HOTEL THAT SEAMLESSLY BALANCES LONDON'S ALWAYS-ON ENERGY WITH THE WELLNESS PROMISE FOR WHICH THE BRAND IS KNOWN, THE PROPERTY ALSO MARKS THE DEBUT OF THE WESTIN HOTELS & RESORTS BRAND IN THE UK MARKET."}